Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:02.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有點話想說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時太倉促
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:09.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 和梅琳的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:15.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒懷疑你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想說的 只是要你別介意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:27.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:29.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:36.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在幾年前剛經歷過一場大戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時應已立下誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:43.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不再重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:50.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我女兒的墓碑 不落下焚燬的話就無法改變世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:52.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何還不醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們協調者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:01:00.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特利葛 薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:05.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊 這次要為藍色清淨的世界而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:10.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡　來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Stampeder照射
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:24.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如此愚蠢地重複著悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:29.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 讓我看看你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:30.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這新面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有點強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:44.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其一正如前所述
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:48.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,毫無疑問是Logos的存在所致
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:55.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:02:00.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是什麼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們終於把他們消滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:08.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為如此 現在我更想說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:14.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這次也要打倒另一個強大的敵人不可
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不打算讓他們進領海嗎  Minerva他們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣根本無處可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布  真打算…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為這點事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:36.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能為這點事就…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們已經沒有戰鬥能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家已經知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:03.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有史以來 人類的歷史中戰爭不斷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:06.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直存在的最大的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是永遠無法克服的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們自身的無知和慾望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:17.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是結束它的時候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可以做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:25.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經可以克服一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:30.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的答案已經在大家自身之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉魯巴多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Plan 全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:40.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,步驟一 多元基因組資料庫 啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Hyper Server 連接確認
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:49.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為賭上人類生死存亡的最後防衛措施
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:53.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此宣布Destiny Plan現在正式開始投入實行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:51.88,Title SEED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}向着新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:50.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Plan是我們協調者至今所掌握的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遺傳學的全部精華
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:56.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,及現在最高水準的技術基礎上所實施的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終極人類救濟措施
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:00.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:07.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的所有資質 性格 智能 才幹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:10.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及嚴重的疾病原因等信息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原本都存在於體內
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事先明確得知這些非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:21.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的你很可能身處在不當的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:30.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人 包括你自己都渾然不知
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而埋沒了自己珍貴的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這對人類全體來說都是重大的損失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:43.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們從瞭解自己的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:47.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及力所能及的事開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:52.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是向著你幸福的未來所邁出的光輝一步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:57.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒什麼好驚訝的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:01.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長的目標是怎樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:03.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:06.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:10.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 突然說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界就…不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:14.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:19.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是儘管如此 議長也不會放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:21.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這你也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在有我們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:29.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長夢想中 任何人都能幸福生活的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是再也不會發生戰爭的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:37.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,創造這樣的世界並維護它就是我們的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那力量就是為此而生的吧 Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而被選為其駕駛員的就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:54.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長選擇你 是因為你比任何人都強
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比任何人都憧憬那樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:04.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:09.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在在談重要的事 稍後再來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:16.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 你做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但你說得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:20.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真正不得了的還在後頭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:22.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:28.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任何時代 變革都必然招致反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.91,0:08:30.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由此提出異議的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和沒有明確的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僅憑不安而唱反調的人必然會出現
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:39.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正如議長所說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:44.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無知的我們 無法得知明天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:46.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是人真的到了不得不變革的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,否則 不會有救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:59.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:00.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:04.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像那個強化人的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:12.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了不再重複那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:16.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須實行這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,變強吧 真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:29.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要保護
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:34.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 和那個新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:37.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:43.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是拯救世人於混沌的最後途徑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:46.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 別管我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭是政治的一部份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:13.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從中無法看到全局
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:17.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,注意艦內的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家應該都和你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:21.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼明確拒絕的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:28.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還只有我們和斯堪迪納維亞王國嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:33.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 每個國家似乎都還不知如何判斷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:38.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由於對Logos的追捕 各國政府都一片混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:43.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也都在他預料之中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:49.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不能再讓世界聽憑他掌握了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過去烏茲米代表對於聯合的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:57.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用辭是對人類精神的侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:00.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這還更甚於前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的理念 無論如何都要守住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:07.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是保護一切的前提
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:08.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正如所料世界的反響不溫不火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:22.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是超出預料嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不太明白才是真心話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,超越人種和國家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然從遺傳基因層面談
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都會困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只聽那些話真的讓人感覺都是好處
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有不安 不會發生戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能獲得幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再說現在議長也很有信用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:49.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但肯定不會只提出計劃就結束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:55.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟是說投入並實行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經進入防衛狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:03.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為必然會拒絕計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:04.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:09.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對方用強硬手段的話只有戰鬥一條路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:21.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:22.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:27.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 對方也這麼想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有戰鬥 這樣只有戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到頭來我們還是戰鬥下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,計劃雖然也令人厭惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:41.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實這種事也是 想早點結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:49.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我們現在也只有戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:52.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有夢想 期盼未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:04.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是賜予所有生命使之生存下去的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論得到什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:09.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果夢想和未來被封印起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:15.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就只能作為亡者存在下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:20.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以生命都是為了獲得未來而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是可以為之而戰的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:30.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們也必須戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:32.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為現在活著的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對欲圖毀滅我們的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:39.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和議長所展示的死亡世界戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:46.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Station One 即將就位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:49.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem控制系統全部運轉正常
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,提前開始能量充填
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:54.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正總得開火一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兼做測試
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:56.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各國有什麼新動向嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:00.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:07.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在明確表示否定的只有奧布和斯堪迪納維亞王國
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此我國堅決反對狄蘭達爾議長提出的計劃投入
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:20.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過也許受到她煽動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Arzachel基地稍微有所動靜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:39.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦總統也表示希望與議長取得聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:43.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和其他國家首腦一樣提出請求
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:44.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,科普蘭也真辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:50.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖無法像她那樣努力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:53.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也得做好一國之長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:58.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴他如何是好的Logos也已經不在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:04.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也好 那就先攻擊Arzachel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:05.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我開始準備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布稍後再說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:08.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該說過
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:16.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為賭上人類生死存亡的最後防衛措施
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:20.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還要與之敵對的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是人類的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:24.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:26.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦隊司令部來電
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合軍Arzachel基地有動靜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:36.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球艦隊與Minerva立即去座標4286集結
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:37.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:48.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然聯合軍還打算打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 看來是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:58.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的事沒關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:00.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉讓你擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算是老毛病了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:04.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那個…我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:08.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別提這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:12.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我說的話 別忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後不論發生什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:18.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰說了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:19.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都要相信議長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界將改變
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來改變它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:35.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那時也需要有人在亂世中作出不同尋常的決斷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:40.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能也會有不明緣由想逃避的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:45.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 只要相信議長就沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:11.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為正確的是他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:31.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是為什麼說這些 突然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:36.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直像電視劇裡快死了的老頭子說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:37.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:43.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實際上我已經沒什麼未來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:48.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,天生染色體端粒過短
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:53.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是克隆人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:02.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球背面高能量體發生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Daedalus基地 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:07.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:08.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:10.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:11.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:13.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準哪裡 明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.69,0:18:18.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線區域4到11
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:19.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Arzachel
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:24.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那這是我軍…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:27.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 那裡已經沒聯合了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:55.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了 已經可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:05.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:07.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:13.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有拆毀嗎 那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:21.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣剩下的聯合兵力也幾乎全滅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那東西的破壞力也不在Genesis之下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:31.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根據中繼站的部署位置能自由瞄準地球各地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:42.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 和奧布聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:44.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與Eternal會合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:47.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請馬上準備出發
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:51.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不服從就是死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:56.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論是哪個 這樣下去世界就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:57.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯繫Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:01.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把雷 查 巴勒路和真 飛鳥調到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.67,0:20:04.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 和機體一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:06.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無處可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:08.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:11.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:16.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 兩人都是FAITH也沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:20.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過沒想到突然那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 真的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:26.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,談了些議長的演說和Destiny Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.17,0:20:30.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是想和你談這些 為什麼雷他…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:31.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:35.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Arzachel被打了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.57,0:20:38.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用聯合的 那個Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 誰幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:44.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為基地有反抗跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:47.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以羅蘭隊進行了攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:48.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:50.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軍隊把那個修好了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過 真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:56.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是好事 也不會一切順利
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來他們會來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:01.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:05.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎定額啟動中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:08.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,電纜管道及FCS啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量傳輸正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,磁場艙及彈藥配送器 空轉正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:17.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,外層防衝擊減震器維持20%輸出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:18.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主動力接通
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:20.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.85,0:21:24.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.65,0:21:35.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的歌姬回歸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暗號坐標 Plazal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:40.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複 真正的歌姬回歸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:51.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要打倒他們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:52.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護你所期盼的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:12.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:26.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了未來而討伐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.33,0:23:28.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了未來而保護
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:31.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼不停戰鬥的現在是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:38.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法忘記的悲傷會讓人拿起劍的話 那麼下次要攻擊的是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.37,0:23:40.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:43.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機動戰士 GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:44.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:48.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,展示已知的道路 Justice
